            "category": "description",
            "text": "A flaw was found in the MongoDB Go Driver. The `Client.BulkWrite` operation does not properly validate database names, allowing a specially crafted name with reserved characters to redirect write operations. This vulnerability could enable an attacker to modify or corrupt data in unintended databases and collections.",
            "title": "Vulnerability description"
          },
          {
